//   - gemini.go:    Gemini CLI (single JSON object with "gemini" message type)
//   - opencode.go:  OpenCode (single JSON object with parts-based messages)
//
// This file holds the shared entry point, format detection, and helper utilities.

// compactJSONL converts JSONL transcripts (Claude Code, Cursor, Factory AI Droid)
// into the compact transcript format, one line at a time.
// Factory AI Droid lines are unwrapped by unwrapEnvelope (droid.go) before conversion.

